# v1.0.9

## Required Environment

- Game patch: FFXIV 7.57 (hotfix 1)
- Dalamud: v15.0.3.9 (API 15)

## Changelog

### New Features

- **Handle mob attacks.** When a mob attacks during an order, the character fights back if his job has a rotation and the mob is safe to fight. Otherwise he runs until nothing chases him. Either way, he then picks the order back up. (`9d9595b20`, `1c334b7cb`)
- **Meld onto equipped tools.** A new Melding option puts the plan's main-hand and off-hand materia onto whatever tools he has equipped, so one etro set works across crafting classes. (`0ae466c5b`)

### Improvements

- Timed gathering waits where he stands, then leaves to land about two minutes before the node opens, instead of hovering at the node or arriving late. (`8bfb39709`)
- When a run cannot travel somewhere, the message names the place and the reason, such as an aetheryte he has not attuned. (`631dc71cb`)
- When the game says "Too far away." at an NPC or summoning bell, he moves to another spot and tries again at once, and he always dismounts first. (`aa95fdedd`, `05f3bb201`)
- Diadem wind pads board more reliably, and pads 17 and 18 now join routes. (`1c3c1fe5c`, `cc6e7479a`)
- Combat farming follows your Mount-up distance setting. (`1d6ad1c54`)
- Crafting rotations solve about a quarter faster. (`321fd20f4`)
- Settings descriptions and panel messages are shorter and clearer, and the food and medicine minimums now say recipe level and node level. (`e93a44f70`, `445f7119d`)

### Fixes

- Orders clear bag space only between tasks, so a craft or gathering task no longer stops partway for Aetherial reduction or Transfer to saddlebag. (`f7670f051`)
- Crafting no longer fails with "A synthesis is still open." or "Unable to execute command while crafting." after the last craft of a batch. (`d2ce36969`, `93cb60ab9`)
- The character no longer freezes in a shop after trading at the Collectable Appraiser, the Scrip Exchange or a gemstone trader. (`45ae73f82`)
- Melding no longer stops with "Unable to execute command under normal conditions." (`1bb41b302`)
- When Miner and Botanist sit at different levels, each plans gathering with his own level and GP, so the lower one no longer plans actions he has not learned. (`c8fcd1e01`)
- Gemstone FATE farming stops attacking a FATE's leftover enemies once the FATE ends. (`667ef2178`)
- Grand Company seal purchases count units already bought, including Ventures, and name your seal floor when seals run short. (`4b7f1582e`)
- Diadem gathering checks food and medicine against each node's real level instead of level 10. (`d70c3d533`)
- When no gathering node is in reach, the refusal names the gatherer level you need. (`445f7119d`)

### Infrastructure

- Update the desktop app together with the plugin to see the new Melding option. (`0ae466c5b`)

### In progress

- Leveling, Cosmic and Ishgard Restoration stay marked work in progress. Leveling now finishes its level-fifteen stage and can list unused HQ gear on retainers, Cosmic handles first visits and Tool Mastery on Auxesia, and Ishgard Restoration carries on after a death. A FATEs run for Shared FATE ranks and bicolor gemstones has no page yet. (`ae24f0cbf`, `24c6476c9`)
